# the text the same day; these two payloads were not, and `bin/prove` reported both
# SETUP-FAIL: the literal was absent from the file the case reads. **A case that
# cannot set up proves nothing and is indistinguishable from a case that passes**,
# which is why the run reports it as its own state rather than as a pass.
