    ("contract-stamp: audit restamps what Step 5 amended",
     AUD, "del", "Step 5-STAMP"),
    ("contract-stamp: INV-STAMP row names its text and token in invariants.md",
     INV, "del", "INV-STAMP"),
    ("contract-stamp: audit emits INV-STAMP with its counts",
     AUD, "del", "blocks the sweep"),
    # ── the authoring-version stamp is COMPARED, not just recorded ───────────────
    # The absent-stamp advisory shipped 2026-09-01 so staleness COULD be computed.
    # Nothing computed it, and two procedures named the missing row as their detector.
    ("version stamp: wf-conform compares it, not merely records it",
     CFM, "del", "def installed_version"),
    ("version stamp: the comparison is numeric, never a string compare",
     CFM, "del", "def version_tuple"),
    ("version stamp: the installed version is read from its anchor, never restated",
     CFM, "del", chr(34) + "references" + chr(34) + ", " + chr(34) + "version.md" + chr(34)),

    # ── ## Interface: a checker, a spec, and no writer (2026-09-05) ────────────────────
    # MEASURED on odyssey-alive: 33 reduced skills, five audits, 33 without the
