     REM, "del", "def add_interface"),
    ("interface: a reduction that would leave no ## Interface is REFUSED",
     REM, "del", "if not has_interface(after)"),
    ("interface: the run supplies the three strings, the script never invents them",
     REM, "del", "The strings are the RUN'S judgment"),
    ("interface: audit T7b passes the flags",
     AUD, "del", "<the shape of what comes back, and whether it is stable>"),
    ("interface: the audit backfills skills reduced before the producer existed",
     AUD, "del", "Step 5-IFACE"),
    # ── handoff (2026-09-07) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    # Each case breaks a DIFFERENT way the design silently degrades into the flag it
    # exists to replace. A detector that fires and hands the finding back is precisely
