    # Delete --if-absent and a re-fired turn writes a second draft of one exchange.
    # Delete the measured figure and the capture rule is an assertion again.
    # Delete the seen-check and the list is re-injected on every turn of a session.
    # Delete the registration and the family ships installed, wired to nothing.
